ividualJobAssign</Name><Description>User can assign any job to themselves that is assigned to their group, and also back to their group from themself</Description></Item5><Item6 xsi:type="typens:JTXPrivilege" GUID="{94519396-5f15-4f2e-b09d-dc238bb0c691}" LastModified="39569.3694328704"><ID>7</ID><Name>CreateVersion</Name><Description>User can create the job version</Description></Item6><Item7 xsi:type="typens:JTXPrivilege" GUID="{d17ee985-d3b8-447f-908a-33ff5dfd35de}" LastModified="39569.3694328704"><ID>8</ID><Name>CreateJob</Name><Description>User can create/clone a job</Description></Item7><Item8 xsi:type="typens:JTXPrivilege" GUID="{63c6c01d-3c7a-42e2-8476-bd02e2d6992e}" LastModified="39569.3694328704"><ID>9</ID><Name>CloseJob</Name><Description>User can close a job when the workflow is complete</Description></Item8><Item9 xsi:type="typens:JTXPrivilege" GUID="{f3cb1b88-0b50-47d9-addd-e783444955c3}" LastModified="39569.3694328704"><ID>10</ID><Name>CanAddAttachesForHeldJobs</Name><Description>User can override a hold to add attachments to a job</Description></Item9><Item10 xsi:type="typens:JTXPrivilege" GUID="{38d2594e-87d3-4353-99e3-52ade91da0a2}" LastModified="39569.3694328704"><ID>11</ID><Name>CanAddCommentsForHeldJobs</Name><Description>User can override a hold to add comments to a job</Description></Item10><Item11 xsi:type="typens:JTXPrivilege" GUID="{26a8d6e7-46a4-49bb-a79d-6bb6a7d1603b}" LastModified="39569.3694328704"><ID>12</ID><Name>CanUpdatePropsForHeldJobs</Name><Description>User can override a hold to modify properties on a job</Description></Item11><Item12 xsi:type="typens:JTXPrivilege" GUID="{e85b8687-9421-4300-917e-77ef25c286d3}" LastModified="39569.3694328704"><ID>13</ID><Name>UpdateProperties</Name><Description>User can update properties on a job</Description></Item12><Item13 xsi:type="typens:JTXPrivilege" GUID="{83ea29b9-394d-4e49-add4-f0a9d7bf55c1}" LastModified="39569.3694328704"><ID>14</ID><Name>AssignAnyJob</Name><Description>User can assign 