I)</Description><Program>http://www.arcgis.com/apps/Viewer/index.html?appid=27f32c6bce164d9487ceb603aeecc153&amp;extent=[JOB:AOI_ENVELOPE]</Program><Arguments/><Visible>0</Visible><ExecutionType>4</ExecutionType><StepDescriptionType>2</StepDescriptionType><StepDescriptionHTML>&lt;font face="Calibri" size=4&gt;Opens a web map for editing and zooms in to the Area of Interest(AOI).&lt;/font&gt;</StepDescriptionHTML><StepDescriptionLink/><StepTypeIndicator>1</StepTypeIndicator><SupportedPlatform>2</SupportedPlatform></Item18><Item19 xsi:type="typens:JTXStepType" GUID="{1D6DDFA3-9FD1-4796-8716-3E39B4CEB95F}" LastModified="42347.8891782407"><ID>20</ID><Name>QC Data in Web Map</Name><Description>Perform Quality Control on the data in web map</Description><Program>http://www.arcgis.com/apps/Viewer/index.html?appid=27f32c6bce164d9487ceb603aeecc153&amp;extent=[JOB:AOI_ENVELOPE]</Program><Arguments/><Visible>0</Visible><ExecutionType>4</ExecutionType><StepDescriptionType>2</StepDescriptionType><StepDescriptionHTML>&lt;font face="Calibri" size=4&gt;Perform Quality Control on the data in web map.&lt;/font&gt;</StepDescriptionHTML><StepDescriptionLink/><StepTypeIndicator>1</StepTypeIndicator><SupportedPlatform>2</SupportedPlatform></Item19><Item20 xsi:type="typens:JTXStepType" GUID="{A5110576-BC46-400A-9760-9DDCD7D06AD4}" LastModified="42326.8963078704"><ID>21</ID><Name>Open Project Map</Name><Description>Opens a project map in ArcGIS Pro.</Description><Program>ArcGISProSteps.OpenMap</Program><Arguments/><Visible>0</Visible><ExecutionType>2</ExecutionType><StepDescriptionType>2</StepDescriptionType><StepDescriptionHTML>&lt;font face="Calibri" size=4&gt;Opens a project map in ArcGIS Pro.&lt;/font&gt;</StepDescriptionHTML><StepDescriptionLink/><StepTypeIndicator>1</StepTypeIndicator><SupportedPlatform>0</SupportedPlatform></Item20><Item21 xsi:type="typens:JTXStepType" GUID="{647BD0E9-F88B-4ACC-92CB-E1F8DA21432B}" LastModified="42326.8964814815"><ID>22</ID><Name>Open Project Task</Name><Description>Opens a Task in the ArcGIS Pro project.</Description><Program>ArcGISProSteps.OpenTask</Program><Arguments/><Visible>0</Visible><ExecutionType>2</ExecutionType><StepDescriptionType>3</StepDescriptionType><StepDescriptionHTML/><StepDescriptionLink>https://pro.arcgis.com/en/pro-app/help/tasks/whatistask.htm</StepDescriptionLink><StepTypeIndicator>1</StepTypeIndicator><SupportedPlatform>0</SupportedPlatform></Item21><Item22 xsi:type="typens:JTXStepType" GUID="{D4C2EADA-0BF9-4F0D-BDBD-D537199B255B}" LastModified="42324.9946990741"><ID>401</ID><Name>Create PDF</Name><Description>Creates a PDF document of the jobs map and attaches it to the job.</Description><Program>JTXSteps.CreatePDF</Program><Arguments/><Visible>0</Visible><ExecutionType>2</ExecutionType><StepDescriptionType>2</StepDescriptionType><StepDescriptionHTML>&lt;font face="Calibri" size=4&gt;Creates a PDF document of the jobs map and attaches it to the job. If the job does not have a job map then a pdf of the jobs  basemap is created.&lt;/font&gt;</StepDescriptionHTML><StepDescriptionLink/><StepTypeIndicator>1</StepTypeIndicator><SupportedPlatform>2</SupportedPlatform></Item22><Item23 xsi:type="typens:JTXStepType" GUID="{B49F1240-C159-4820-AA0B-00E8145023BB}" LastModified="42325.0098148148"><ID>402</ID><Name>Reassign Job</Name><Description>Reassigns the job to the Technicians group.</Description><Program>JTXSteps.ReassignJob</Program><Arguments>/assignType:"group" /assignTo:"Technicians"</Arguments><Visible>0</Visible><ExecutionType>2</ExecutionType><StepDescriptionType>2</StepDescriptionType><StepDescriptionHTML>&lt;font face="Calibri" size=4&gt;Reassigns the job to the Technicians group.&lt;/font&gt;</StepDescriptionHTML><StepDescriptionLink/><StepTypeIndicator>1</StepTypeIndicator><SupportedPlatform>2</SupportedPlatform></Item23><Users xsi:type="typens:JTXUserSet" GUID="{47290CEF-999B-412C-8A41-B5FC0CDB9511}" LastModified="0"><Count>2</Count><Item1 GUID="{a144e3bf-fcdb-46ab-b881-71649584dfa